#undef NDEBUG
// Review HL: session routes on a POWL net mined under a typed key, and the
// temporal profile families keyed by one on the stream and dataframe
// adapters.
//
// - /api/mine's POWL keyed by an attribute of other objects than text
//   (powl_activity_key) projects the log as pm4py's net names the events:
//   /api/align miner=powl meets the net's labels by == as the less-memory
//   search does (standard costs), the POWL net's decoration counts the
//   firings of the fitting traces, and /api/stochastic-map?miner=powl fits
//   the net replaying the key it was mined by.
// - /api/analyze-behavior temporal_profile / temporal_conformance on the
//   stream adapter read pm4py's convert_to_event_stream of the log shape
//   (an XES upload's legacy objects); on an XES upload's dataframe the typed
//   activities are str() of the frame's objects, and a NaN activity's pairs
//   are dropped as pandas' groupby drops them.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-hl: tc/mkhl.py, ct/pa.py, ct/pdec.py, ct/bh.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_hl_tests <minera_server>
